{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33022","headline":"碧寻宴上有怀知己 · 曹邺","name":"碧寻宴上有怀知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荻花芦叶满溪流，一簇笙歌在水楼。\n金管曲长人尽醉，玉簪恩重独生愁。\n女萝力弱难逢地，桐树心孤易感秋。\n莫怪当欢却惆怅，全家欲上五湖舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}